2026-06-03 15:07:09,738 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] ### 7. Persistence Mechanisms
2026-06-03 15:07:09,739 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - Registry HKLM\...\Run keys: Standard entries only (McAfee, VMware, QuickTime, Java, Google Update, Adobe Reader, Dropbox)
2026-06-03 15:07:09,740 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - No obviously malicious Run key entries detected
